  "solution": "Given: **7 ÷ 2 × 5 − 4 + 2 = 15 **\n\n**Option 1): **+ and − \n\nAfter interchanging + and − the equation will be \n\n__** 7 ÷ 2**__ × 5** +** 4 **-** 2 = 15\n\n⇒ __**3.5 × 5**__ + 4 - 2 = 15\n\n⇒ **__17.5 + 4 __**- 2 = 15\n\n⇒ 21.5 - 2 = 15 \n\n⇒ **19.5 ≠ 15**\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option 2): ÷ and + **\n\n**After interchanging ÷ and + the equation will be **\n\n**7 + 2 × 5 −__ *4 ÷ 2*__ = 15 **\n\n**⇒ 7 +* *__*2 × 5* __− 2 = 15**\n\n**⇒ __*7 + 10*__ - 2 = 15**\n\n**⇒ 17 - 2 = 15**\n\n⇒ **15 = 15**\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\n**Option 3): **− and ÷\n\nAfter interchanging − and ÷ the equation will be \n\n 7 **-** 2 × __**5 ÷ 4**__ + 2 = 15 \n\n⇒ 7 - **__2 × 1.25__** + 2 = 15\n\n⇒ **7** - 3.5 **+ 2 **= 15\n\n⇒ __**7 + 2 **__- 3.5 = 15\n\n⇒ 9 - 3.5 = 15 \n\n⇒ **5.5 ≠ 15**\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option 4): **× and ÷ \n\nAfter interchanging × and ÷ the equation will be \n\n7 × __**2 ÷ 5**__ − 4 + 2 = 15 \n\n⇒ **__7 × 0.4__** - 4 + 2 = 15\n\n⇒ **2.8** - 4 **+ 2** = 15\n\n⇒ __**2.8 + 2**__ - 4 = 15\n\n⇒ __**4.8 - 4**__ = 15 \n\n⇒ **0.8 ≠ 15**\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"option 2\".",
